        "Description": "Good Evening 47, These two MFs are Shooting a movie at the entrance of Viktor Novikov&apos;s Castle, They insult anyone that tries to enter through them Forcing all guests to enter from the left side of the fountain. Our Client Viktor Novikov Noticed This and Hired us to Eliminate them. Rumor has it Novikov himself entered their way and they kicked them out of the castle so he jumped over the fence to enter, Novikov also told us to Kill him, GoodLuck Initiate!",
